:: RobinTemple Garden Work
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $phase is 'robin-temple-garden' and $RobinTemple.work_day is Time.days>>
  <<unset $phase>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
        Water has collected along the flower bed. You clear the channel while Robin lifts the trailing stems out of the mud. <<He>> holds them steady as you tie them to their supports. By the time you finish, water is running towards the drain instead of pooling around your shoes.
      <<elseif $temple_garden gte 60>>
        Robin carries the shears while you spread a cloth beneath the hedge. You trim the branches growing over the path, then gather the cuttings together. <<He>> steps back to check the line before you put the tools away.
      <<else>>
        Robin hands you a pair of gloves, then kneels beside the flower bed. You loosen the soil while <<he>> gathers the weeds into a bucket. When it fills, you carry it to the compost heap together.
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
        A branch scrapes against the wall. Robin looks up sharply, then takes the tool you hold out. "Could we take these back together?" <<He>> waits while you gather the last of the tools.
      <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 50>>
        "That looks better." Robin brushes the soil from <<his>> gloves. "We should have done that side first." <<He>> grins when you point to the dirt on <<his>> face.
      <<else>>
        "Thanks for helping." Robin brushes the soil from <<his>> gloves. <<He>> smiles at you, then goes back for the bucket you nearly left behind.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>
        花坛边积了一洼水。你疏通水沟，罗宾把垂到泥里的枝茎扶起来，等你将它们绑回支架。收工时，水已经顺着沟往下流，不再淤在你们脚边。
      <<elseif $temple_garden gte 60>>
        罗宾拿来园艺剪，你在树篱下铺开布。你们剪去伸到小路上的枝条，再把碎枝拢在一起。收好工具前，<<he>>退后几步，检查有没有漏剪的地方。
      <<else>>
        罗宾递给你一副手套，随后在花坛旁蹲下。你松土，<<he>>把拔出的杂草拢进桶里。桶满了，你们一起提到堆肥处。
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
        一根树枝刮过墙面。罗宾猛地抬头，接过你递来的工具。“能一起把这些送回去吗？”<<He>>留在原处，等你收好最后几件工具。
      <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 50>>
        “好多了。”罗宾拍掉手套上的土。“早知道就先弄那边了。”你指指<<his>>沾着泥的脸，<<he>>咧嘴笑了。
      <<else>>
        “谢谢你帮忙。”罗宾拍掉手套上的土，朝你笑笑，又折回去拿差点落下的桶。
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
  <<gtending>><<ggrace monk>><<gtiredness>><<glove>><<ggconviction 'Robin'>>
<<elseif $RobinTemple.work_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Robin is no longer available for the shift. The shared work remains unfinished.' '罗宾已经无法继续这班职务，共同工作还未完成。'>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The work is already done today.' '今天的工作已经做完了。'>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'garden'>><<lanLink ['Return to the garden', '返回神殿花园'] 'Temple Garden'>><<run maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').visit(0)>><</lanLink>><br>
